        <Param val="WORD JUDGMENT TASK&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;On each trial you will see a QUESTION at the top of the screen and a WORD below it. Answer the question about the word as quickly and accurately as you can:&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Press Y for YES&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Press N for NO&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;The question will change during the task. Sometimes you will be asked “Is it a living thing?” and sometimes “Does it contain the letter E?” Read the question each time.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Each word stays on screen for only 3 seconds, so respond right away.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;First you will do a few practice trials.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Press SPACE to begin." valType="str" updates="constant" name="text"/>
